      "Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria": "<ul><li>When an international customer reaches checkout, checkout is usable for them. </li><li>When prices are displayed in a non-EUR market, they are correct for that market. </li><li>When an international order is placed, it can be fulfilled like a domestic one. </li> </ul>",
