      "System.CreatedDate": "2026-09-07T20:37:29.74Z",
      "System.Description": "<p>When international customers reach an English-only, EUR-only checkout that offers cards and PayPal only, I want checkout localized for international customers, so I can support the shop's international expansion. </p><p>The shop already ships to several EU markets; checkout has not followed the international expansion. Sales wants five additional markets live this year. Support reports non-English tickets already take days to resolve. Finance has no position on display currencies and FX pricing, and there is no single owner for international checkout. </p><p>Scope is not defined: markets, languages, currencies, and local payment methods are all open. </p>",
